ADDENDA <Act No. 16938, Feb. 4, 2020>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning establishment of Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency)
(1) The Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency established as an incorporated foundation under Article 32 of the Civil Act as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the Protection Agency established under Article 55-2 when it has completed the registration for incorporation with permission from the Commissioner of the Korean intellectual Property Office after resolution by its governing board about the succession of its status. In such cases, the Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation shall be deemed dissolved, notwithstanding the provisions of the Civil Act regarding the dissolution and liquidation of corporations.
(2) The property, rights and obligations of the Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation shall be deemed the property, rights and obligations of the Institute, and the name of the Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation stated in the registry of its property, rights and obligations and in other public records books shall be deemed the name of the Protection Agency.
(3) The value of the property which is construed as the property of the Protection Agency shall be the book value as of the day immediately before the registration of its incorporation under paragraph (1).
(4) An act conducted by the Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation before this Act enters into force shall be deemed an act conducted by the Protection Agency, and any act conducted with respect to the Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation shall be deemed an act conducted with respect to the Protection Agency.
(5) The executives and employees of the Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed to have been elected or appointed as the executives and employees of the Protection Agency. In such cases, the terms of office for the executives shall be the remainder of their terms of office provided in the articles of incorporation of the Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation.
(6) The Korea Intellectual Property Protection Agency as an incorporated foundation designated as a public institution by the Minister of Strategy and Finance pursuant to the Act on the Management of Public Institutions at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the Protection Agency designated as a public institution.
Article 3 (Transitional measures concerning establishment of Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency)
(1) If the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency established as an incorporated association pursuant to Article 32 of the Civil Act as at the time this Act enters into force completes registration for establishment after adopting a resolution at its board of directors with regard to succession to its status and obtaining authorization thereof from the Commissioner of the Korean Intellectual Property Office, it shall be deemed the Strategy Agency established under Article 55-5. In such cases, the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency shall be deemed dissolved, notwithstanding the provisions regarding dissolution and liquidation of corporations in the Civil Act.
(2) The property, rights and obligations of the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency as an incorporated foundation shall be deemed the property, rights and obligations of the Institute, and the name of the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency as an incorporated foundation stated in the registry of its property, rights and obligations and in other public records shall be deemed the name of the Strategy Agency.
(3) The value of the property which is construed as the property of the Strategy Agency shall be the book value as of the day immediately before the registration of its incorporation under paragraph (1).
(4) Any act conducted by the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency before this Act enters into force shall be deemed an act conducted by the Strategy Agency, and any act conducted with respect to the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency shall be deemed an act conducted with respect to the Strategy Agency.
(5) The executives and employees of the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency as an incorporated foundation at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed to have been elected or appointed as the executives and employees of the Strategy Agency. In such cases, the terms of office for the executives shall be the remainder of their terms of office provided in the articles of incorporation of the Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency as an incorporated foundation.
(6) The Korea Intellectual Property Strategy Agency as an incorporated foundation designated as a public institution by the Minister of Strategy and Finance pursuant to the Act on the Management of Public Institutions at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the Strategy Agency designated as a public institution.

